==English==

===Etymology===
The term may have arisen from the Indian word for a hired thug, ''[[goonda]]''.

===Pronunciation===
*Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-uːn|-uːn]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[thug]], a usually muscular henchman with very little intelligence (also known as a 'Hired Goon'). The term ''goon'' rose to prominence in this context thanks to frequent usage in [[Popeye]].

----
===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# (slang) also, gooner. An avid masturbator who enjoys extended sessions, chronically or compulsively approaching the "point of no-return" for as long as possible, perhaps many minutes or even hours at a time.

----
===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# (slang) To achieve the trance-like blissful state reached when a masturbator rides the edge of ejaculatory inevitability for as long as possible, perhaps many minutes or even hours at a time.

----

